        {
          "text": "Mu nshita itali ine iyo emo imfumu ya mu Egupto yafwilile. Lelo abena Israeli bena balelilishika nganshi ukucula mu busha bwabo, balelilila kuli Lesa ukuti abatuule, no kulilishika kwabo pa mulandu wa busha bwabo kwafikile kuli Lesa. ",
          "type": "text",
